Z||000000||anthony_86gt||04-23-2001||08:15 PM||||Guys i need your help badly.  I have a 86 gt.  i replaced the distributor cap and rotor, took the battery out and now my car wont start.  I have spary and a lot of gas!  Every time i try and start it i smell gas terribly.  It cranks over fine but wont start.  i removed all of my battery cables and im going to replace them.  could the battery connections be the problem?  Guys give me some more stuff to check.  I need my baby back!  Thanks   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">||||reg||8
